<title>USA: TABLE - Acuson Q2 results.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Acuson Q2 results.</headline>
<dateline>MOUNTAIN VIEW, Calif. 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>ACUSON CORPORATION</p>
<p>		CONDENSED CONSOLIDATED STATEMENTS OF OPERATIONS</p>
<p>		    (In thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>				 Three Months Ended  Six Months Ended</p>
<p>				   Jun 28,  Jun 29,  Jun 28,  Jun 29,</p>
<p>					1997     1996     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net sales		    $112,692 $ 74,355 $220,273 $159,181</p>
<p> Cost of sales		  60,853   39,500  117,673   80,283</p>
<p>  Gross profit		  51,839   34,855  102,600   78,898</p>
<p>Operating expenses:</p>
<p>Selling, general and</p>
<p>   administrative	     29,802   35,707   58,763   62,474</p>
<p>  Product development	 14,388   16,743   27,612   33,115</p>
<p>Total operating expenses</p>
<p>				    44,190   52,450   86,375   95,589</p>
<p>Income (loss) from operations</p>
<p>				    7,649  (17,595)  16,225  (16,691)</p>
<p> Interest income, net	    250    1,012	334    1,911</p>
<p>Income (loss) before income</p>
<p>  taxes			   7,899  (16,583)  16,559  (14,780)</p>
<p>Provision for (benefit from)</p>
<p>  income taxes		   2,155  (5,999)    4,970  (5,458)</p>
<p> Net income (loss)	     5,744 (10,584)   11,589  (9,322)</p>
<p> Earnings (loss) per share    0.19   (0.39)     0.38   (0.34)</p>
<p>Weighted average common shares</p>
<p>  outstanding		   30,686   27,137   30,687   27,167</p>
<p>The company reported net income of $5.7 million, or $0.19 per share, for the second quarter, versus a loss of $10.6 million, or $0.39 per share, for the same period in 1996.  The loss for the second quarter of 1996 resulted from the worldwide introduction of the company's Sequoia ultrasound systems, which necessitated substantial expenditures for manufacturing, marketing and other launch-related expenses.</p>
